Package: piper-tts-server
Architecture: all
Depends: python3,
         gettext-base,
         piper-tts (>= 1.8.0),
         speech-dispatcher,
         speech-dispatcher-espeak-ng,
         pulseaudio-utils,
         systemd,
         ${python3:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: piper-tts-voices-ar,
            piper-tts-voices-ca,
            piper-tts-voices-de,
            piper-tts-voices-en,
            piper-tts-voices-es,
            piper-tts-voices-fr,
            piper-tts-voices-it,
            piper-tts-voices-ru
Description: Piper TTS server over a Unix socket
 Resident Piper TTS server and client with a per-voice LRU cache, raw PCM
 audio streaming over a Unix socket, systemd socket activation and idle
 auto-shutdown.
 .
 This package depends on piper-tts, speech-dispatcher, pulseaudio-utils and
 systemd, and configures speech-dispatcher and systemd to use the server.

